rong>New greenhouse</strong></p><p><em>Meets criteria for sustainability</em></p><ul><li>Simple and <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">35</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-plus-3-t7-l-q35\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> to build</li><li>Made mainly from local materials (mud or stone for the walls, wood and <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">36</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-plus-3-t7-l-q36\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> for the roof)</li><li>Building and maintenance done by local craftsmen</li><li>Runs solely on <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">37</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-plus-3-t7-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> energy</li><li>Only families who have a suitable <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-plus-3-t7-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> can own one</li></ul><p><strong>Design</strong></p><ul><li>Long side faces south</li><li>Strong polythene cover</li><li>Inner <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-plus-3-t7-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> are painted black or white</li></ul><p><strong>Social benefits</strong></p><ul><li>Owners' status is improved</li><li>Rural <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-plus-3-t7-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> have greater opportunities</li><li>More children are educated</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/practice_test_plus_3_academic_listening_test_7_4.mp3"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-q1","part_id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-p1","group_id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"terminal","correct_answer_variants":["terminal"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3127749_1","order_index":1,"points":1},{"id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-q2","part_id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-p1","group_id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"Pantera","correct_answer_variants":["Pantera"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[2],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3127749_2","order_index":2,"points":1},{"id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-q3","part_id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-p1","group_id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"east","correct_answer_variants":["east"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[3],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3127749_3","order_index":3,"points":1},{"id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-q4","part_id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-p1","group_id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"07765 328411","correct_answer_variants":["07765 328411"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[4],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3127749_4","order_index":4,"points":1},{"id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-q5","part_id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-p1","group_id":"en-plus-3-t7-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"hotel 